    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "what do you mean by \"step off the treadmill\"? i feel like i'm already at the limit. like i've given everything and there's literally nothing left to give, yet the bills keep coming and the debt just grows. it feels like there's no way out that doesn't involve more suffering.",
