      "content": "but there's no quiet path. that's the thing. i can't just \"stop\" and exist without paying for it. if i stop working, i lose the apartment. if i lose the apartment, i lose everything. even \"resting\" costs money i don't have. the only way to actually stop the math from breaking, the only way to actually be \"still\" like you're saying, is to just... not be part of the system anymore. is that what you're implying? that the only real solution is just to opt out entirely?",
